---
source: tests/mod.rs
description: should successfully print the short help and exit
---
A task runner with DAG-based parallelism

Usage: engage [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  self  Run a built-in command
  just  Run a specific group or task
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -f, --file <FILE>  Manually choose the Engage file
  -j, --jobs <JOBS>  Maximum amount of tasks to run at once
  -h, --help         Print help information (use `--help` for more detail)
  -V, --version      Print version information

